doc ///
  Key
    tan
    (tan,InexactNumber)
  Headline
    compute the tangent
  Usage
    tan x
    tan I
  Inputs
    x:RR
    I:RRi
  Outputs
    :RR
      the tangent of @TT "x"@
    :RRi
      an interval containing the tangents of the points of @TT "I"@
  Description
    Example
      tan 1
